					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210212,
					"content": "锅容量比看上去的要小。\\n里面的内容物就这样全部不见了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210213,
					"content": "噗哈…嗯？这个汤，香倒是很香，但是怎么感觉尝不出什么味道呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210214,
					"content": "兰穆护昆达在上！你们这些那菈，怎么回事！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210215,
					"content": "兰、兰那罗？到底是从哪里突然出现的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210216,
					"content": "从地里啦！不说这个，你们怎么能偷喝我做的汤，那可是我兰阿帕斯辛辛苦苦做出来的汤耶！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210217,
						730210220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210217,
					"content": "对不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210218,
					"content": "对不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210219,
					"content": "哼，偷喝了我的汤，一句对不起就够了吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210223,
					"content": "你们知道在这里做汤有多难吗？一会儿，天上下雨。一会儿，太阳出来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210224,
					"content": "嗯？说来最近「法留纳神机」稳定了很多，天气也正常了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210225,
					"content": "其实就是我们啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210226,
					"content": "哼，修好「法留纳神机」的一定是那个那菈那样的好那菈，才不是你们这样的「汤小偷」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210227,
					"content": "小偷什么的，别说得这么难听嘛！我们只是因为味道太香才…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210228,
					"content": "不过，既然这么困难，为什么要在这里做汤呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210229,
					"content": "哼，烹饪最关键的东西，必须每天都要取得的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210230,
						730210231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210230,
					"content": "是身为厨师的自尊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210232,
					"content": "是水！是水啦！汤的香味，受水影响很大，当然要用最好的水来做汤啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210233,
					"content": "我一路上，在水天丛林取各个地方的水来做汤。采集了好多好多、有树上的叶子那么多的水样以后，才找到了最好的「活源水」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210234,
					"content": "那才是配得上无忧节的「至上珍馐」！就算跟你们说这个，你们肯定也不明白吧…只有之前那个那菈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210235,
					"content": "说到这个，其实我们是从兰帕卡提那来的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210236,
					"content": "向兰阿帕斯述说事情的经过。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210237
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210237,
					"content": "啊，原来是「妹妹」的那菈朋友！而且，要举办无忧节了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210238,
					"content": "不过没有关系，我已经取得「活源水」，我的「至上珍馐」已经完成。就在这个锅里…然后…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210239,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210240,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210241
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210241,
					"content": "欸嘿嘿。你别难过，汤闻起来真的很香…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210242,
					"content": "啊，我的「活源水」！水的源头住着「亚普修那」，好不容易等到它们离开水源，我才取了一锅…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210243,
					"content": "不行，你们一定要再取一锅「活源水」赔给我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210244,
					"content": "「亚普修那」…？那是什么东西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210245,
					"content": "哼，那菈对森林真是一点也不了解。就是那种住在水里的，四条腿、有尾巴、会咬咬的东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210246,
					"content": "…狗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210247,
						730210248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210247,
					"content": "狗不住在水里吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210249
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210249,
					"content": "啊，也对。那「亚普修那」到底是什么呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210250,
					"content": "别管「亚普修那」了！我要水！而且要那边的「活源水」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210251,
					"content": "#好啦好啦…{NICKNAME}，没办法，我们走吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210252,
						730210253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210252,
					"content": "哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210254
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210254,
					"content": "一定要「活源水」，其他的水都不行！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210253,
					"content": "走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210254
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210248,
					"content": "哪来的水狗。纯水之狗吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210249
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210231,
					"content": "是不忘初心的意志？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210220,
					"content": "都、都是派蒙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210221,
					"content": "#喂！{NICKNAME}，你居然出卖我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210222,
					"content": "我才不管是谁喝的啦，反正我的汤没有了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210208,
					"content": "这不太好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210209,
					"content": "我是真的很好奇嘛，呜，我就偷偷喝一口，就一口！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210210,
					"content": "要是喝坏肚子就不好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210211,
					"content": "哼哼，可不要小看派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7302103,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
